WEBVTT

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.540
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:27.570 --> 00:00:30.510
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.950
who travel the world, searching 
for your ingredients.

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:40.120
And the ingredient at the 
top of this world is GOD,

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:43.250
which is being sought by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:52.000
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.640
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:03.310
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.110
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.110 --> 00:01:08.750
With you guys

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:11.920
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:14.350
If we join forces

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.360
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:20.960
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:28.530
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:34.040
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:36.110
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:39.110
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.110 --> 00:01:42.110
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:47.350
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.360
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.360
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:58.200
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:01.170
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:05.100
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:07.170
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.090
Today's the day.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:31.860
People disappear

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.200
from cities all over the world.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.380
Delicious!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:53.450
Nothin' beats drinking 
Ruby Beer in a limousine!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.120
I'm so nervous

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.030
that I can't even swallow this Air Aqua.

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:06.130
Hey, what are you so stiff for?

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:07.830
It's a festival, remember?

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.700
Relax and have fun!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.370
But I still can't believe it.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:15.370
I get to participate in the Cooking Fest,

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.510
where the best chef in 
the world is determined.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:23.180
And only the top 100 ranked 
chefs get to be in it.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:26.350
Since you're ranked 88th, of 
course you're a participant!

00:03:27.190 --> 00:03:28.490
But...

00:03:28.490 --> 00:03:32.960
...everyone in the top 100 is a famous chef.

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:39.600
Cooking superstars from all over 
the world are coming here today!

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:43.400
It'll be fine!

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:47.570
They don't got anything you don't.

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.740
I guarantee it.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:55.250
Toriko-san...

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:03.760
Anyway...

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:07.290
There are so many people here I 
want to get autographs from...

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.600
What should I do?! I'm so nervous!

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.300
That's what you're nervous about?!

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.400
I don't believe you!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.470
By the way, this car...

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.680
Is it really a long train?!

00:04:24.340 --> 00:04:26.640
We'll be arriving at our 
destination in just a moment.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.120
That's...

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.120
...the island of my dreams.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:42.990
The holy land of chefs everywhere!

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:46.330
Cooking Island!

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:52.770
Inevitable Turmoil?! The Cooking Fest Begins!

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:01.050
Cooking Festival

00:05:06.080 --> 00:05:07.990
Please take a look, everyone.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.750
An incredibly long line!

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.030
One billion people from all over the 
world have come here to be spectators.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.790
It takes place only once every four years.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.060
Today, the curtain rises 
on the Cooking Festival!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:22.570
So let's get started by 
interviewing some people

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:24.800
who have been looking forward 
to watching the Fest.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:30.270
Hello. What time did you 
start waiting in line today?

00:05:30.270 --> 00:05:31.740
Today?!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:35.510
This is my 63rd day standing in line!

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:37.880
P-Pardon me!

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:40.490
Uh... L-Longe?!

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.850
Yeah, I guess...

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:45.660
My hair does keep getting longer...

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.530
This is where you're supposed 
to shout, "It's Zonge!"

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:52.260
At any rate,

00:05:52.260 --> 00:05:53.770
what feverish excitement...

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:58.140
I can see how the live broadcast 
brings in a rating of over 95%.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.440
So I'll get back on track,

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:02.870
and give you a heaping helping 
report on this excitement!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.560
So this is Cooking Island...

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.070
It's finally about to begin,

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.130
Koma-chan!

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:41.350
Look at all those people!

00:06:41.350 --> 00:06:45.220
Yeah. And there's lots of food 
stalls with tasty-lookin' treats!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.690
There are a lot of kids here too.

00:06:48.690 --> 00:06:50.690
It's a cooking holiday today.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:52.790
A public holiday, or rather,

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:55.730
a "foodday".

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:59.700
Hey, that's Turtle Melon Bread!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.800
Wait, if you get out here... Toriko-san!

00:07:03.330 --> 00:07:04.340
Toriko?!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.270
No, really?!

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:06.140
Seriously?!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.340
It is him! Toriko, one of the Four Kings!

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.680
Toriko!

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:13.440
Thank you for killing the Four-Beasts!

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:16.450
Oh boy...

00:07:16.450 --> 00:07:20.180
He's become even more famous 
after beating the Four-Beasts.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.420
Our savior!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.960
Savior? You mean me?

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:28.830
Sunny-san!

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.600
It's Sunny!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:33.360
Sunny of the Four Kings!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.040
Don't mob me, it's annoying!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.740
Hair Lock!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.040
I can't move!

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:46.740
It isn't good to get rough with your fans.

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.550
Coco's here too!

00:07:54.150 --> 00:07:55.890
Coco-sama!

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.860
Please don't touch me.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:01.290
I am poisonous, after all.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.800
What, poisonous?!

00:08:05.800 --> 00:08:07.470
But he's so handsome...

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:11.370
What the hell?! Poison isn't 
as beautiful as my skill!

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:13.770
Everyone shut the hell up!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.740
It's Zebra!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:25.620
Adapt, dammit!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:34.160
I'm deeply thankful!

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:35.790
Grandpa?!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.900
I'm deeply thankful! I'm deeply thankful!

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.570
Children!

00:08:40.570 --> 00:08:43.000
Burn this sight into your mind.

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:45.100
They're...

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:48.470
...the Four Kings!

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:54.380
Four Kings!

00:08:54.380 --> 00:08:56.210
Thank you!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.720
Everyone!

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:08.460
It's Chef Komatsu!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.960
Chef Komatsu!

00:09:16.830 --> 00:09:18.600
Thank you, Chef Komatsu!

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:22.070
You're our savior too.

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:24.380
Thank you...

00:09:24.380 --> 00:09:26.940
Congratulations on cracking 
the top 100, Chef Komatsu!

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.610
Good luck in the Fest!

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.880
I'll be rooting for you, Chef Komatsu!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.350
It's appreciated...

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.490
This makes me want to slurp it up again.

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.260
Livebearer-san!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:48.400
Even after making the Medicinal Mochi, 
you've grown leaps and bounds as a chef!

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.140
Thank you!

00:09:52.670 --> 00:09:54.940
But "slurp it up", you don't mean...

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.910
...what's in my brain?!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:09:59.810
That's okay, right? No harm in dreaming!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.750
R-Right...

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.350
When we get in there,

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:06.920
I intend to get my revenge for 
losing at Gourmet Tasting.

00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:10.560
You're the one person I have to beat.

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.190
Oh, come on...

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:15.890
You're 17th place in the world ranking, 
Livebearer-san, so compared to you,

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.900
I'm no competition.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:20.930
But still, since I am 
doing it, I challenge you

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.430
to a fair fight!

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:27.440
That's the spirit, Komatsu-kun.

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:28.670
Setsuno-san!

00:10:28.670 --> 00:10:32.610
You just might have a chance.

00:10:33.080 --> 00:10:35.750
Hearing you say that, Setsuno-san,

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:37.880
it's like a dream!

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:40.750
As I seriously look at you,

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.620
I'm looking forward to this more and more!

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.020
Well, see you in the kitchen.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.560
Right!

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.330
Now Komatsu is a superstar chef himself.

00:10:53.330 --> 00:10:55.070
Cooking up the Medicinal Mochi

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:58.170
suddenly gave him a big boost 
in the world chef rankings.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:00.370
Don't get cocky.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:08.880
When you perfected the Century Soup,

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.750
I had no idea you would get this far.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.790
Patch of the G7!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.820
Chef Komatsu...

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.960
Y-Yes?!

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:26.160
Your inner potential is inestimable.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:30.270
You may even pose a threat 
to the top-ranked chefs.

00:11:30.270 --> 00:11:33.810
Oh, no... I don't, um...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.910
Sure are a lot of security police.

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:43.050
Do the G7 taste masters 
chosen by IGO really need

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.920
that many bodyguards?

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:47.590
They're not here for me.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:50.250
I think you know that, Toriko.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:00.830
Well...

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:02.370
It's not like we

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.970
just came to the Fest to have 
a good time either, right?

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:16.350
This is the main site

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:19.050
of the Cooking Festival, just 
before the event begins.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:22.520
I'm coming to you live from the 
entrance of Cooking Stadium.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.060
Here they are!

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:30.260
Famous Gourmet Hunters, Revivers and more 
have come here from around the world!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:33.400
That's the famous cutler, Melk the Second!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:36.030
And I see the Gourmet Knight, Aimaru too!

00:12:36.030 --> 00:12:39.400
They're arriving in droves 
to witness firsthand

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:42.170
the birth of a supreme chef.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:54.790
This is Cooking Stadium...

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:02.730
The food festival that takes place 
only one day every four years,

00:13:02.730 --> 00:13:04.760
the Cooking Festival,

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:08.830
will soon begin!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:27.520
You in front of the TV, you spectators here,

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:30.320
you people standing in front of 
your hotel window, everybody!

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:32.360
Are you watching this?!

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:35.060
This is the 50th Cooking Festival!

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:39.430
There are many, many people here at 
Cooking Stadium, 100 million in fact!

00:13:39.430 --> 00:13:43.630
In just a moment, the excitement 
is going to boil over!

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:49.970
50th Cooking Festival Opening

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:49.670
31 billion, 200 million people all over 
the world are watching this event!

00:13:49.670 --> 00:13:52.580
The economic effect is an astonishing...

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:55.650
...five quadrillion yen!

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:59.950
While the winner gets the title 
of Super Cook and that's all!

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:01.590
But!

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:06.220
The chef who gets that title is 
ranked number one, becomes famous,

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:11.360
and will forever be showered with 
more money than they can spend!

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:14.000
In its 200-year history,

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:17.400
there have only been five 
people to attain the title

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:20.170
of Super Cook!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:22.640
That's just five chefs!

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:28.650
Listen to that crowd!

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:31.380
Komatsu is really gonna be 
in a cooking showdown here!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.020
I can't get enough!

00:14:33.380 --> 00:14:36.750
Hey! Keep the food comin'!

00:14:37.090 --> 00:14:38.790
Oh, honestly...

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.890
Can't you eat without bellowing?

00:14:40.890 --> 00:14:42.160
Never mind, look at that.

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.060
All the members of G7 are here.

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:47.500
That's a sight you rarely get to see.

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.800
That's the Cooking Fest for you.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:55.070
And there are a lot of other 
gourmet big shots here too.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:02.780
Why am I in the peanut gallery?!

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:05.550
You know how many days I waited 
in the goddamn line?!  {may want to take out the "god" :)}

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:07.720
What the hell is this?! Huh?!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:10.290
Calm down, Zonge-sama!

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.600
That man...

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.370
Incidentally, I'm your MC,

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.300
Munage!

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:28.810
I host a gourmet program that’s been 
number one in ratings for 15 years straight!

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:30.340
Munage!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.780
Munage!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.810
Yes! Yes, yes, yes!

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.150
Last year, they were about 
to give me a co-host,

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:38.080
Mr. Udege, who's number two in the ratings,

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.350
but as you can see, I'm by myself.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:43.390
I did some behind-the-scenes 
squishing and I'm safe!

00:15:43.390 --> 00:15:44.920
What do you mean, "squishing"?!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.520
You've got a wicked heart, Munage!

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.800
I don't care, as long as I 
get and guard my Fest pay!

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:53.030
What the hell is that?!

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.230
I couldn't hear!

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.770
And now, let's get back to business.

00:15:57.140 --> 00:16:00.540
There are 100 participants 
in the Cooking Festival!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:04.380
Come on, please!

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:28.200
Okay, who will be the first 
person to step into the arena?

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:32.300
There he is! We're starting 
off with a big name!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:36.740
Our reigning champion! The man who is 
number one in the world chef rankings!

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.210
Who won here 14 times!

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:40.580
The foremost gourmet authority 
who needs no introduction!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:42.580
The legendary Cooking King,

00:16:42.580 --> 00:16:44.220
Zaus!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.450
Zaus!

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.920
Chef Zaus!

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.420
The top guy came out first!

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.720
And next, we have...

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:54.590
...the 6th-ranked chef!

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.490
He's dreamy!

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:59.360
The owner-chef of the sweets shop, Prince,

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:01.000
Anyo Jr.!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:04.140
Can he make our audience go 
to heaven with a sweet taste

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.500
that melts their whole bodies?!

00:17:07.440 --> 00:17:09.110
Anyo-sama!

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:12.080
Okay, appearing next is...

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:13.580
Ranked number four!

00:17:13.580 --> 00:17:15.880
The owner-chef of Dhamala's Curry,

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:18.450
who silences all spicy critics!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:19.750
The Curry King,

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.390
Dhamala Sky the 13th!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:25.890
Will the spices he create 
shake up this festival?!

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:28.330
Come on, next chef!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:30.230
Ranked number five!

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.930
As you know, he's the leading 
figure in Medicinal Cooking!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:34.730
The owner-chef of Meal King,

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.970
One Millimeter Yuda!

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:41.240
As a two-time champion in the past, 
he's definitely in the running to win!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:49.280
Oil

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:44.510
Oh! Oh! Oil! Here he comes!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:49.280
The man who has not red blood, but 
oil flowing through his veins!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.450
The Oil Artisan, Wabutora is here!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.120
Actually, I do have blood...

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:57.190
There he is!

00:17:57.190 --> 00:18:01.830
The former boss of the underground 
cooking world, Livebearer!

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:04.930
He stole knowledge from many, many people,

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:07.270
so he can cook in every style under the sun!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:11.400
You didn't have to say that!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.540
Wow!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.440
And at last, one you've been waiting for!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:21.380
The chef who's won the most times by far,

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.180
with 28 victories,

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.050
ranked in a commanding second place,

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:28.120
the heroine of the festival, 
everyone's favorite,

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.220
the Gourmet Living Legend,

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.760
Setsuno-san!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.960
You can call me Setsunon.

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:35.560
There's Granny Setsu!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.230
Hold back some!

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:40.470
If you go all out, the festival 
will be over in a flash!

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:41.930
Oh my!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:47.240
The world-ranked chefs just keep coming!

00:18:50.210 --> 00:18:51.680
Miss Sumire!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.780
Now, everybody look!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:57.880
There he is!

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.220
He started with Century Soup,

00:19:00.220 --> 00:19:01.920
then discovered Mors Oil,

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:05.790
the smart cook who recently surprised 
the world with Medicinal Mochi!

00:19:05.790 --> 00:19:09.430
He ranks in at an impressive 88th place!

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:12.200
The head chef at Hotel Gourmet's restaurant!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.000
I give you Chef Komatsu!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.370
Chef Komatsu!

00:19:17.370 --> 00:19:18.800
Good luck!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:20.740
Thank you...

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:32.450
Can I really square off against all of them?

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:36.420
Komatsu!

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.790
Show 'em...

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:42.530
...your power!

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:44.360
Show the world!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.830
Toriko-san!

00:19:50.900 --> 00:19:52.170
I will!

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:03.610
Oil

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.640
Is everyone ready?

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.530
Alright.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:58.970
Shall we go?

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:10.010
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:21:10.010 --> 00:21:16.850
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:22.330
Only a smile has no flavor, 
so wipe your tears

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:28.770
After a downpour of rain from the 
sky, the sun always rises high

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:34.510
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:40.040
My heart races and I become captivated

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:49.090
Don’t give up! I’m closest to 
you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:53.620
Always believe in yourself!

00:22:00.970 --> 00:22:04.070
Find Yun! Run, Run, Yun!

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:07.210
Yun is hiding somewhere in the 
image you're about to see,

00:22:07.210 --> 00:22:08.610
so please find him!

00:22:08.610 --> 00:22:11.580
Today, Yun's Hiding Level is 21.

00:22:08.610 --> 00:22:16.210
Hiding Level: 21

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.750
The allotted time limit is 15 seconds.

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:15.750
Let's have a heaping helping of start!

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:21.320
The Four Kings are having fun 
with art in the autumn season.

00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:25.920
But where could Yun be hiding?

00:22:25.920 --> 00:22:29.090
Pay attention to the top half of the screen.

00:22:31.900 --> 00:22:34.070
Yun is... right here!

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:43.010
How was it?

00:22:43.010 --> 00:22:47.850
I wish I had a heaping helping of 
art skills like Yun and the others.

00:22:47.850 --> 00:22:49.850
And now on to our next segment!

00:22:52.130 --> 00:22:53.580
The qualifying round starts!

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:56.050
Wait, they're swimming, not cooking?

00:22:56.620 --> 00:22:59.380
That person who's drowning... is that...!?

00:22:59.830 --> 00:23:02.720
Komatsu is in a Pinch?! Triathlon Cooking!

00:23:02.720 --> 00:23:04.790
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
